{"name":"Sworn #1","description":"Sworn is an ownerless onchain registry of verifiable wallet feats. One card per wallet; every trait is a fact about the claimant wallet that minted the card, never about the holder. Direct-read traits are read from the settled WhitelistCurator; chain-proven, panel-attested and shared-fact traits are attested by the IMD oracle through the Intake and verified in the registry. Allowlists read hasTrait, never ownerOf. Facts about the wallet that minted it; direct traits frozen at mint; transferable.","image":"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns=%22http://www.w3.org/2000/svg%22%20viewBox=%220%200%201000%201000%22%20style=%22font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace%22%3E%3Crect%20width=%221000%22%20height=%221000%22%20fill=%22%230a0a0a%22/%3E%3Cg%20transform=%22translate(500.0%20480.0)%22%3E%3Cpolygon%20points=%2289.0,0.0%2044.5,77.1%20-44.5,77.1%20-89.0,0.0%20-44.5,-77.1%2044.5,-77.1%22%20fill=%22none%22%20stroke=%22%23151515%22%20stroke-width=%224%22%20stroke-linejoin=%22round%22/%3E%3C/g%3E%3Cg%20transform=%22translate(500.0%20313.7)%22%3E%3Cpolygon%20points=%2289.0,0.0%2044.5,77.1%20-44.5,77.1%20-89.0,0.0%20-44.5,-77.1%2044.5,-77.1%22%20fill=%22none%22%20stroke=%22%23151515%22%20stroke-width=%224%22%20stroke-linejoin=%22round%22/%3E%3C/g%3E%3Cg%20transform=%22translate(644.0%20396.9)%22%3E%3Cpolygon%20points=%2289.0,0.0%2044.5,77.1%20-44.5,77.1%20-89.0,0.0%20-44.5,-77.1%2044.5,-77.1%22%20fill=%22none%22%20stroke=%22%23151515%22%20stroke-width=%224%22%20stroke-linejoin=%22round%22/%3E%3C/g%3E%3Cg%20transform=%22translate(644.0%20563.1)%22%3E%3Cpolygon%20points=%2289.0,0.0%2044.5,77.1%20-44.5,77.1%20-89.0,0.0%20-44.5,-77.1%2044.5,-77.1%22%20fill=%22none%22%20stroke=%22%23151515%22%20stroke-width=%224%22%20stroke-linejoin=%22round%22/%3E%3C/g%3E%3Cg%20transform=%22translate(500.0%20646.3)%22%3E%3Cpolygon%20points=%2289.0,0.0%2044.5,77.1%20-44.5,77.1%20-89.0,0.0%20-44.5,-77.1%2044.5,-77.1%22%20fill=%22none%22%20stroke=%22%231